For shapefile projection, it was Two-point equidistant <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Two-point_equidistant_projection>:

> > Slot "proj4string":
> > CRS arguments:
> >  +proj=tpeqd +lon_1=31.777540712777 +lat_1=-24.2850983814202
> > +lon_2=31.8880063672957 +lat_2=-25.0247369074034 +datum=WGS84
> > +ellps=WGS84 +towgs84=0,0,0

You can transform it to long/lat like this, then it should be recognized by ArcGIS:

> spTransform(spt, CRS("+proj=longlat +datum=WGS84"))

